  "description": "During a family trip at a secluded pension, Eunchae sneaks into the room of Seunghyun, her long-time crush, to steal a bold kiss. However, the man who responds fiercely in the pitch black is not Seunghyun, but her arch-nemesis, Kang Taeyun! \n\n'Why? Are you upset it’s not him? Don’t worry. I’m better.' \n\nFollowing this fatal mistake, Taeyun seizes Eunchae's weakness and proposes a provocative one-month bet involving a 'leash.' \n\nWill Eunchae be able to win this dangerous game and reclaim her pride, or is she walking straight into a trap he meticulously designed?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14128159), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297090072), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/better_than_brother), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079108), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260423), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=v5i2), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=ao3d), Toon365, ZzangComic, [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H049681429), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H049681429), [Aladin](https://www.aladin.co.kr/shop/wproduct.aspx?ItemId=395434517), [KyoboBook](https://ebook-product.kyobobook.co.kr/dig/epd/ebook/E000013100742), [Yes24](https://www.yes24.com/product/goods/191692942)",
